{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d396b08ad0f2ce8c26518cb3eb7d9a2f3473a79f109caec1229b7af39c61d488", "ja": "（育のコスプレグラビア企画の撮影で、キャンプ場に\nやってきた。育は色んな場所を動き回っている……）", "zh": "（为了拍摄育的角色扮演写真企划，来到了露营地。育正在到处跑来跑去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "614c871fa3473a98c827b308d4f92fafd8e8118c905f774b8fcd417eabf26a7e", "ja": "う～ん……ここにもいない。\nどうしよう、ぜんぜん見つからないよぉ……。", "zh": "嗯～……这里也没有。\n怎么办，完全找不到啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c8441b5482b5be97b337670018caa459d122a6136c464fc5cd3ea010c7f1ba8e", "ja": "育？　さっきから何してるんだ？", "zh": "育？你从刚才开始就在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "38f8724b1f0e8566491ceb827e894ba44e265c96e2c4cbe9784a46b0b8011d1d", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nあのね、ここに虫っているのかな？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n那个，这里有没有虫子呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1004_p", "source_sha256": "088da500ee89274a14fbd943b95750e63b864a1d5067733a21294446f74090a1", "ja": "虫？　あっ、それで何度もしゃがみ込んでたのか。\n撮影に必要なら用意するけど……。", "zh": "虫子？啊，原来你是因为这个一直蹲下去的。拍摄需要的话我可以去准备，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "458304a0ba4970f36c935106d41d605f26c7bc385539d241bb7411e5c879ef86", "ja": "それじゃダメだよ。だって、きつねさんは\n誰かにご飯を用意してもらったりしないでしょ？", "zh": "那样不行哦。因为狐狸小姐不是不会有人替她准备饭菜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1006_p", "source_sha256": "573d5707c3e5275cb88d674a07d0ebebca15beb31c3085cf41b60a5931a3271d", "ja": "えっ、ご飯……？", "zh": "诶，吃饭……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "00d48d48ac9e387066166f86d07c2e80e345722715b8b73d10f3a32c2bae99d7", "ja": "そうだよ。きつねさんは、小さい動物や虫を食べるん\nだって。わたし、学校のずかんで見たんだ。", "zh": "是啊。听说狐狸会吃小动物和虫子。我在学校的图鉴上看到过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "76bfb122802a3ae2fb18023d3081ee5ab49f062c57b8ce054278fa09beb5d5d9", "ja": "でも、ここに動物さんはいないから。虫を探して、\nきつねさんになりきろう！　って思ったの。", "zh": "可是这里没有动物，所以我就想找找虫子，装成狐狸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ac576a7438cbfa33c267a47f51d16706d4947f4b8051d0cfde10db319aea94de", "ja": "そうか。育はキツネの狩りをマネしてみたんだな。\n石の裏とか草の影とかも見てみたか？", "zh": "原来如此。育是试着模仿狐狸捕猎了啊。石头后面、草丛的阴影里之类的地方，也找过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "2f5256919297c9dda625e481494f92f9342c0d42b381225014b8285dc06c5654", "ja": "うん。環ちゃんに教えてもらったから、やってみたよ。\nでも、ぜんぜんダメだった……。", "zh": "嗯。是环教我的，所以我就试了试。\n但是，完全不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "c8830bbd4938e9c2a1bd43d1b1d82e8f62429d4e28797672cf2762c95b3f4f63", "ja": "これじゃ、ごはんが食べられないよ。\nわたし、りっぱなきつねさんになれないね……。", "zh": "这样下去，就没法吃饭了。\n我没法成为一只出色的小狐狸了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e9a774cdc01729bf0cddb5694db1d94e0faefddfa95e89e9f35d3e9100778d75", "ja": "そんなことないよ。\n育は、立派なキツネになる一歩を踏み出したんだ！", "zh": "没那回事。\n育已经迈出了成为出色狐狸的第一步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "d4e4a2cd90aea647a6a2d323cf3a5c4d168ff7275910ebd70dbcbdbe58b2cd04", "ja": "えっ？　どうして？", "zh": "咦？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1014_p", "source_sha256": "af1cafdb314eed1c4b7fb25175149c95412fac7e3d5bdd319a0edb903be47816", "ja": "狩りは、いつも成功するとは限らないだろ？\nキツネだって、失敗する日があると思うんだ。", "zh": "狩猎也不是每次都能成功，对吧？\n我觉得狐狸也会有失败的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "809cbcf0cb32995310f5c0bb90dd8a4e275f76c9962d888d7fce31c4e445d457", "ja": "……そっか。今のわたしみたいに、\nきつねさんも悲しかったりするんだね。", "zh": "……这样啊。狐狸也会像现在的我一样，\n感到难过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d47618fb4caf5e234e35bd83e27a28d1d5f2ee638e6ab52349948602e2606bcb", "ja": "ああ。今の育は、キツネそのものだ！\nだから育が感じたままのキツネを表現してみよう。", "zh": "嗯。现在的育，就像真正的狐狸一样！\n所以，试着把育感受到的狐狸表现出来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "a8e39eb5110d45f18b6235675844acbfba810f5e9df9f3aabdee1bf860870e4f", "ja": "うん、わかった！　{$P$}さん、\nわたし、ステキなきつねさんになってみせるね！", "zh": "嗯，明白了！{$P$}先生，我一定会变成一只棒棒的小狐狸给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0533_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2c3feea0e6cd07b2a9ed24429a512b7cbce62cf81348016e4962e8e35623e0ff", "ja": "（育は、感情豊かな愛らしいキツネ姿をみせてくれた。\nスタッフさん達にも大好評。いい写真になったな！）", "zh": "（育展现出了感情丰富、惹人怜爱的狐狸模样。工作人员们也赞不绝口。真是拍出了很棒的照片啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
